Note on the data

This license covers the analysis code in this repository only. It does not
cover the underlying data, which are not redistributed here. The National
Health and Nutrition Examination Survey files and the NCHS Linked Mortality
Files are US Government public-use datasets, downloaded at run time from the
Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Their use is governed by the NCHS
Data User Agreement, which prohibits any attempt to identify individual
respondents.
